This file is the test set for the LLM evaluation project (Task 1). The evaluation script (Task 2)
asks a language model each `question` and the scoring module (Task 3) compares its reply with
`expected_answer`.

    python generate_test_cases.py             write test_cases.json (next to this script) and check it
    python generate_test_cases.py --check     only check an existing test_cases.json (after a manual edit)
    python generate_test_cases.py --out FILE  write to a different file

To add a case, copy one block in CASES below, edit it, and run the script again (see README.md).

IMPORTANT: every restaurant fact below (hours, prices, policies, dishes) is INVENTED SAMPLE DATA so
the tool can be built and tested. Replace the answers with Spice Route's real policies before the
results are used to judge a model.

Needs only Python 3.8+ and no extra packages.
"""
